Part 4  class 'every column meets a fixed row'  (star-shaped in a line)
==============================================================================
per-column GF: sum_{b<=0<=t} x^(t-b+1) = x/(1-x)^2 ; columns independent
(consecutive columns always overlap at row 0 => connectivity automatic)
GF = 1/(1 - x/(1-x)^2) = (1-x)^2/(1-3x+x^2)
dominant singularity x* = (3-sqrt5)/2 = 0.381966  =>  mu = phi^2 = 2.618034
